flowchart TD
  Action[User invokes AI-dependent action] --> Session{Session decision}
  Session -->|ready plus allowed| Request[Issue backend request]
  Session -->|non-AI or missing| Block[Do not issue request]
  Request --> Safety{Safety available and allow?}
  Safety -->|allow| Runtime{Lease and model ready?}
  Safety -->|block or unavailable| Closed[Fail closed with localized notice]
  Runtime -->|yes| Result[Real validated AI result]
  Runtime -->|no| Unavailable[Backend unavailable or retry state]
  Result --> Persist[Persist authorized result]
  Block --> Paths[Retry setup, Settings, sign out or non-AI path]
  Closed --> Paths
  Unavailable --> Paths
